{{also|Armband|armbånd}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|arm|band|notext=1|type=exocentric}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Flame, not lame-armband.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[band#Noun|band]] [[wear#Verb|worn]] around the [[arm#Noun|arm]], usually to [[symbolize]] [[mourning#Noun|mourning]] or [[protest#Noun|protest]].
#* {{RQ:Telegraph|author=Jeremy Wilson|title=England Under 21 5 Iceland Under 21 0: Match Report|date=10 November 2011|url=http://www.telegraph.co.uk/sport/football/teams/england/8882713/England-Under-21-5-Iceland-Under-21-0-match-report.html|passage=A sell-out crowd of 10,000 then observed perfectly a period of silence before the team revealed their black '''armbands''', complete with stitched-in poppies, for the match. After Fifa’s about-turn, it must have been a frantic few days for the England kit manufacturer. The on-field challenge was altogether more straightforward.}}
# {{lb|en|sports}} A band worn around the arm of the [[captain#Noun|captain]] of a [[team#Noun|team]].
#* {{RQ:Guardian|author=Louise Taylor|url=http://www.theguardian.com/football/2015/mar/04/newcastle-united-manchester-united-premier-league-match-report|date=4 March 2015|passage=The biggest cheer of the night came shortly afterwards. St James’ Park finally found its voice to welcome back Jonás Gutiérrez into a Newcastle side for the first time since his diagnosis with testicular cancer 17 months ago. Hugged by his friend Coloccini, Gutiérrez was handed the captain’s '''armband''' after replacing Ryan Taylor at left-back and promptly collected a booking for fouling Adnan Januzaj&nbsp;– on for a frustrated Angel Di Maria.}}
# {{lb|en|swimming}} One of a [[pair#Noun|pair]] of [[inflatable#Adjective|inflatable]] [[plastic#Adjective|plastic]] bands, normally [[wear#Verb|worn]] on the [[upper arm]]s, to [[help#Verb|help]] the [[wearer]] (often a [[child#Noun|child]]) [[float#Verb|float]] in [[water#Noun|water]] and [[learn#Verb|learn]] to [[swim#Verb|swim]].
#: {{synonyms|en|armfloat|floaty<q:chiefly US, informal>|water wing}}

